{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"tracerProvider","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": (any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"TracerProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:16OpenTelemetryApi14TracerProviderP","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")?","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When set, the SDK emits spans for every NFC operation (PACE, DG reads, passive\/active"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"auth, signing) under a root "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"eidkit.session"},{"type":"text","text":" span. Spans carry only structural metadata"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(outcome, byte counts, integer IDs) — no PII or card data is ever recorded."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"If nil (default), ","type":"text"},{"code":"OpenTelemetry.instance.tracerProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is used, which is a no-op","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unless the host app has registered a global provider via ","type":"text"},{"code":"OpenTelemetry.registerTracerProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Sentry \/ OTLP setup","type":"heading","anchor":"Sentry--OTLP-setup"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let exporter = OtlpHttpTraceExporter(","    endpoint: URL(string: \"https:\/\/o….ingest.sentry.io\/api\/…\/otlp\/v1\/traces\")!,","    config: .init(headers: [\"x-sentry-auth\": \"Sentry sentry_key=…\"])",")","let provider = TracerProviderBuilder()","    .add(spanProcessor: BatchSpanProcessor(spanExporter: exporter))","    .with(resource: Resource(attributes: [","        \"sdk.name\": AttributeValue.string(\"eidkit-ios\"),","        \"deployment.environment\": AttributeValue.string(\"production\"),","    ]))","    .build()","EidKit.configure(EidKitConfig(tracerProvider: provider))"]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/eidkit\/eidkitconfig\/tracerprovider"]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit","doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/EidKitConfig"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenTelemetry "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TracerProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" for session telemetry."}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/EidKitConfig\/tracerProvider","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"metadata":{"externalID":"s:6EidKit0aB6ConfigV14tracerProvider16OpenTelemetryApi06TracerE0_pSgvp","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"EidKit"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"tracerProvider"},{"kind":"text","text":": (any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TracerProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:16OpenTelemetryApi14TracerProviderP"},{"kind":"text","text":")?"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Property","symbolKind":"property","title":"tracerProvider"},"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit/EidKitConfig/tracerProvider":{"url":"\/documentation\/eidkit\/eidkitconfig\/tracerprovider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"OpenTelemetry "},{"code":"TracerProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for session telemetry."}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"tracerProvider"},{"kind":"text","text":": (any "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:16OpenTelemetryApi14TracerProviderP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"TracerProvider"},{"kind":"text","text":")?"}],"type":"topic","title":"tracerProvider","identifier":"doc:\/\/EidKit\/documentation\/EidKit\/EidKitConfig\/tracerProvider","kind":"symbol"},"doc://EidKit/documentation/EidKit":{"url":"\/doc